From c98ed1f6c62361584137ba75306866b535ee3fcc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aaron <aaronmedeiros@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 16:57:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] peak detection: expose raw frame metrics

---
